  "prompt": "For each month from January to December 2025, show Mailvora's total ad spend and how much it changed from the previous calendar month, as a percentage of the previous month's spend (12.5 for 12.5%), rounded to 1 decimal. Spend days are UTC days. Every month of 2025 has spend. Only 2025 counts, so January shows change_pct as missing. Return three columns, in this order: month (the first day of the month), spend_eur and change_pct. Return one row for each month. Any row order is fine.",
